===========================================================================

This directory contains the source files and the documents relevant to
"legal reasoning system by analogy based on Goal-Dependent Abstraction". 
These files are shown as follows: 

    README ............. List of the files (in Japanese)
    README.english ..... List of the files (This file)
    INSTALL ............ Installation Manual
    advertise.txt ...... Material for advertisement (in Japanese)
    advertise.english .. Material for advertisement (in English)
    manual.txt ......... User's Manual
    name.txt ........... Copyright
    user.txt ........... Imagination of the users
    pub.txt ............ List of the publication
    src/ ............... Directory for Source Files
      main.kl1 ......... Main Module
      newgda.kl1 ....... NEWGDA System Modules
    sample/ ............ Directory for Sample Data Files
      demo.in .......... Sample input data based on 'demo.cl'
      demo.cl .......... Sample knowledge
    doc/ ............... Directory for Documents
      newgda.txt ....... Brief about our system
      catalog.txt ...... Catalog for advertisement (Previous version)
      catalog.html ..... HTML file corresponds to Catalog file

